WEBVTT

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:31.815
DF: I think it changed over time,

00:07:31.839 --> 00:07:35.514
I think very early on,
it was about the entrepreneur,

00:07:35.538 --> 00:07:38.285
the small business, the founder,

00:07:38.309 --> 00:07:43.093
and enabling them to do what they love

00:07:43.117 --> 00:07:45.515
and start the companies
that mattered to them,

00:07:45.539 --> 00:07:49.213
and all these companies
that were going to go change the world.

00:07:49.237 --> 00:07:52.792
I think as the company got a little bigger

00:07:52.816 --> 00:07:56.519
and there was excitement
around the reach of the idea,

00:07:56.543 --> 00:07:59.640
and building more of a lifestyle brand,

00:07:59.664 --> 00:08:03.089
it started to become
a little more consumer centric